- **`loadAlgolia()`** — used for Algolia-backed views (Top Stories, Last 24h, Last 48h, Last week). **Was missing all filter word/domain checks.**

When a user sets "brain" as a filter word, stories containing it are correctly hidden in non-Algolia views but show up in Top 24h/48h views.

